# Common APIs

This specification defines the Common APIs that apply to Data Holders in all sectors.

```diff
Added the Get Configuration v1 endpoint

Updated request headers in authenticated endpoints, resulting in new versions:
 - Get Customer
 - Get Customer Detail

- x-fapi-auth-date
- x-fapi-customer-ip-address
+ x-fapi-end-user-present
```

